\boxed{total} & = 125\text{ cents} + 20\text{ cents}\\
& = 145\text{ cents}

Now, to solve for the amount left after buying the candy, we subtract the cost of the candy:
\boxed{amount left} & = 145\text{ cents} - 55\text{ cents}\\
& = 90\text{ cents} = \boxed{90} \qquad \text{(answered in the prescribed format)}

